<title>HONG KONG: Moody's says may cut Thailand long-term ratings.</title>
<headline>Moody's says may cut Thailand long-term ratings.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday that it has placed the A2 foreign-currency sovereign ceilings for bonds and bank deposits of Thailand on review for possible downgrade.</p>
</text>
